WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:18.160
I brought the pieces
I could not mend

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.180
The things I promised
I'd never do again

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:31.300
I brought the questions
I tried to hide

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.960
Every reason
I thought You'd turn aside

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:45.140
But You never asked
For a better version of me

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.980
You only said
Come

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:55.360
I bring You what I am
You give me who You are

00:00:55.360 --> 00:01:01.620
I bring the wounded places
You meet me where they are

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:07.680
I bring You empty hands
You fill this weary heart

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:14.860
I don't have to hide
I don't have to run

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:24.160
You say
Come as you are

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:33.760
I thought that mercy

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:39.820
Was something earned
That I should fix myself

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:46.660
Before I could return
But grace was waiting

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:51.660
Before I knew
I came with nothing

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:59.180
And found everything in You
You never asked

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:05.500
For perfection at the door
You only said

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:11.080
Come
I bring You what I am

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:17.200
You give me who You are
I bring the wounded places

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:23.800
You meet me where they are
I bring You empty hands

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:29.580
You fill this weary heart
I don't have to hide

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:35.140
I don't have to run
You say

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:41.140
Come as you are

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:05.740
When I am tired
Come

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.840
When I am burdened
Come

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:11.840
When I have failed again
Come

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.960
When I am ashamed
Come

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:21.220
Not when I'm stronger
Not when I'm whole

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:30.400
Not when I've earned it
Come

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:36.620
Come to the mercy
Come to the grace

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:45.940
Come to the Savior
He knows your name

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:52.360
I bring You what I am
You give me who You are

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:58.700
I bring the wounded places
You meet me where they are

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:04.580
I bring You empty hands
You fill this weary heart

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:12.000
I don't have to hide
I don't have to run

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:17.780
You say
Come as you are

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:24.160
I bring You all my weakness
You give me all Your grace

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:31.080
I bring You every failure
You never turn Your face

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:37.760
Nothing left to prove
Nothing left to earn

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:45.860
Only open arms
And one invitation

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:54.120
Come as you are

00:04:54.120 --> 00:05:04.640
I bring You what I am
You give me who You are
